BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 187.8 Tm (systemic flow resistance?) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.3 Tf 0.1 0.33 0.58 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 171.1 Tm (Answer: C. Higher viscosity and higher resistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 154.8 Tm (Explanation: More red cells increase blood viscosity and consequently vascular resistance, raising the heart's) Tj ET
