BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 605.7 Tm (31. A bleeding patient has a nearly normal arterial pressure but cold skin and reduced urine output. What is) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 592.0 Tm (the best conclusion?) Tj ET
