BT /F2 9.3 Tf 0.1 0.33 0.58 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 728.3 Tm (Answer: B. Stretch of myocardial fibres strengthens contraction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 712.0 Tm (Explanation: Within the physiological range, more end-diastolic filling stretches fibres and increases developed) Tj ET
